  "localized_copy": [
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_001",
      "fields": {
        "level_label": "LEVEL 5:",
        "title": "The Lizard in the Living Room",
        "key_label": "KEY ACQUIRED:",
        "key_acquired": "CALM",
        "objective_label": "MISSION OBJECTIVE",
        "objective": "How to stop the 'Dance of Rage' and use breathing to wake up the tiny Wizard sleeping in your forehead.",
        "status_label": "LOADING MAP ASSETS... [COMPLETED]"
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_002",
      "fields": {
        "speaker_label": "NINI",
        "text": "I HATE THIS!"
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_003",
      "fields": {
        "story_heading": "THE LIZARD IN THE LIVING\nROOM",
        "log_label": "SYSTEM LOG >>",
        "text": "Friday morning. Nini squealed, yanking a knot on her favorite necklace. It was a sound only dogs could hear. Her face was red, and she was doing a little 'dance of rage' - stomping her feet and shaking her fists. 'It's tight! It hurts! I feel hot and scratchy all over!'\n\nMimi rushed in, waving a wooden spoon like a wand. She took a huge, theatrical breath to show Nini how it's done."
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_004",
      "fields": {
        "speaker_label": "MIMI",
        "text": "Stop! Who is dying? Lizard and Wizard! Breathe!"
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_005",
      "fields": {
        "log_label": "SYSTEM LOG >>",
        "text": "Then Alio ran into the room, wearing a colander on his head and carrying a butterfly net."
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_006",
      "fields": {
        "speaker_label": "ALIO",
        "text": "Where?! Where is the lizard?! Dilo said if an Anger Lizard gets into your nose, it lays eggs in your brain!"
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_007",
      "fields": {
        "log_label": "SYSTEM LOG >>",
        "text": "He started waving the net around Nini's head. 'Calm down, Nini! I'll catch it! Don't sneeze, or you'll shoot eggs everywhere!'\n\nNini stopped crying for a second and looked at her brother with huge, wet eyes."
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_008",
      "fields": {
        "speaker_label": "NINI",
        "text": "Alio... The Lizard is NOT real. It's inside my HEAD. It's a feeling!"
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_009",
      "fields": {
        "log_label": "SYSTEM LOG >>",
        "text": "Alio dropped the net. He turned pale."
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_010",
      "fields": {
        "speaker_label": "ALIO",
        "text": "Oh no... Dilo didn't say how to get a lizard out of a brain! Do we need to use a vacuum cleaner?! Mammi, get the vacuum!"
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_011",
      "fields": {
        "log_label": "SYSTEM LOG >>",
        "text": "Luli snorted laughter into her juice box."
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_012",
      "fields": {
        "speaker_label": "LULI",
        "text": "Alio, you are impossible. It's a metaphor. The Lizard (Amygdala) is the part of your brain that panics and fights. The Wizard (Prefrontal Cortex) is the smart part that solves problems. They are both in there."
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_013",
      "fields": {
        "speaker_label": "ALIO",
        "text": "Oh. So I don't have to call the zoo?"
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_014",
      "fields": {
        "speaker_label": "MIMI",
        "text": "No. But they cannot both be awake at the same time. Right now, Nini's Lizard is screaming so loud that her Wizard is hiding in the basement. We have to breathe to wake the Wizard up. In... Out..."
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_015",
      "fields": {
        "speaker_label": "ALIO",
        "text": "I'm blowing out the lizard! PHEW! Go away, reptile! Leave Nini alone!"
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_016",
      "fields": {
        "log_label": "SYSTEM LOG >>",
        "text": "They breathed together three times. Big, slow, swooshing breaths. Nini's shoulders dropped. Her fists opened. The red color faded from her cheeks. She took one last deep breath and blinked, looking at the necklace in her hand."
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_017",
      "fields": {
        "speaker_label": "NINI",
        "text": "It worked. My brain feels... cooler. Like someone opened a window. She touched the knot gently. A minute ago, the knot looked like a monster. Now it's just a string. My Wizard says we need a needle to fix it."
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_018",
      "fields": {
        "speaker_label": "MIMI",
        "text": "See? You can't fix a delicate knot with angry paws. You needed the Wizard's steady hands."
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_019",
      "fields": {
        "speaker_label": "NINI",
        "text": "Also... Alio looks like a space-chef."
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "node_id": "world01_mission_005_node_020",
      "fields": {
        "log_label": "SYSTEM LOG >>",
