        "heading": "THE BRAIN SECRET (Lizard vs. Wizard)",
        "science_label": "The Science:",
        "science": "Your brain has two bosses. The 'Lizard' (Amygdala) handles danger and panic. The 'Wizard' (Prefrontal Cortex) handles thinking and solving puzzles. When the Lizard sees danger (or a knot!), he locks the Wizard in the basement.",
        "in_story_label": "In The Story:",
        "in_story": "Luli explained that the Lizard isn't a real animal, but a part of the brain. When Nini got frustrated, her Lizard took over, and she couldn't 'think' anymore."
