        "heading": "THE TOOL ('Box Breathing')",
        "science_label": "The Science:",
        "science": "How do you bring the Wizard back? By breathing slowly! Slow breaths send a signal to your brain saying: 'We are safe. Turn off the alarm.'",
        "in_story_label": "In The Story:",
        "in_story": "Mimi and Alio breathed loudly ('In... Out...'). After three breaths, Nini said her brain felt 'cooler' and like 'someone opened a window.' That was the moment the Lizard went to sleep and the Wizard woke up."
      }
    },
